# Descriptor: [B- -> X(D_s* K) l- nu] dummy-resonant gap mode, e and mu, cc
# NickName: Bu_DsStarKlnu_dummyres_gapmodes
# Documentation: B -> D_s* K l nu via wide dummy resonance (m=2.8 GeV, w=3.0 GeV).
#   Isospin/spin partner of decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/DsKenu, swapping the ground-state D_s
#   for the vector D_s* -- generated to compare line shapes for the ground/excited D_s
#   admixture question raised for the Ds(*)K(*) gap-filling estimate (Browder/Mizuk slides).
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260903

Alias DsK0sig D_0*0
Alias anti-DsK0sig anti-D_0*0
ChargeConj DsK0sig anti-DsK0sig

Particle DsK0sig      2.8 3.0
Particle anti-DsK0sig 2.8 3.0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 DsK0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 DsK0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

Decay DsK0sig
1.0 D_s*- K+ PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-DsK0sig

End
